## Part 2: Playground Demo

### 2.1 File Pair

- **Demo**: `src/features/playground/demo-<name>.tsx` (e.g. `demo-buttons.tsx`)
- **Settings**: `src/features/playground/demo-<name>-settings.tsx` (e.g. `demo-buttons-settings.tsx`)

### 2.2 Settings Component Pattern

```tsx
'use client'

import { useEffect } from 'react'
import { DemoRoot, SettingSelect, SettingToggle } from './components-utils'
import { useReset, useSettings } from './settings-store'
import { Separator, type ComponentProps } from '@/ui'

export type ComponentDemoState = {
  variant: NonNullable<ComponentProps['variant']>
  size: NonNullable<ComponentProps['size']>
  color: NonNullable<ComponentProps['color']> | 'null'
  someToggle: boolean
}

const defaultState: ComponentDemoState = {
  variant: 'default',
  size: 'md',
  color: 'null',
  someToggle: false,
}

export function DemoComponentSettings() {
  const reset = useReset<ComponentDemoState>(defaultState)
  const { variant, size, color, someToggle } = useSettings<ComponentDemoState>()

  // eslint-disable-next-line react-hooks/exhaustive-deps
  useEffect(() => reset(), [])

  return (
    <DemoRoot>
      <SettingSelect id="variant" label="Variant" value={variant} options={['default', 'outline', ...]} />
      <SettingSelect id="size" label="Size" value={size} options={['xs', 'sm', 'md', 'lg', 'xl']} />
      <SettingSelect
        id="color"
        label="Color"
        value={color}
        options={[
          { label: '— (inherit)', value: 'null' },
          { label: 'primary', value: 'primary' },
          { label: 'secondary', value: 'secondary' },
          { label: 'contrast', value: 'contrast' },
        ]}
      />
      <Separator />
      <SettingToggle id="someToggle" label="Some toggle" checked={someToggle} />
    </DemoRoot>
  )
}
```

When options are objects (`{ label, value }[]`), use `value: 'null'` for inherit and pass `color={color === 'null' ? undefined : color}` to the component in the demo.

### 2.3 Demo Component Pattern

```tsx
'use client'

import { DemoRoot, DemoSection } from './components-utils'
import { type ComponentDemoState } from './demo-<name>-settings'
import { useSettings } from './settings-store'
import { Component, Stack } from '@/ui'

export function DemoComponent() {
  const settings = useSettings<ComponentDemoState>()
  const { variant, size, someToggle } = settings

  return (
    <DemoRoot>
      <DemoSection
        title="Interactive"
        desc="Обёртка `Component` на базе **shadcn** — краткое описание"
        separator
      >
        <Component variant={variant} size={size} someProp={someToggle} />
      </DemoSection>
      <DemoSection title="Variants" separator>
        <Stack gap={2} wrap align="stretch">
          {['default', 'outline', 'secondary'].map((v) => (
            <Component key={v} variant={v} label={v} />
          ))}
        </Stack>
      </DemoSection>
      <DemoSection title="Sizes">
        <Stack gap={2} wrap align="stretch">
          {['xs', 'sm', 'md', 'lg', 'xl'].map((s) => (
            <Component key={s} size={s} label={`Size ${s}`} />
          ))}
        </Stack>
      </DemoSection>
    </DemoRoot>
  )
}
```

### 2.4 DemoSection Usage

- **title**: Section heading (h3)
- **desc**: Optional, supports Markdown (`**bold**`, `` `code` ``)
- **separator**: Adds `<Separator />` after section (except last)

### 2.5 Best Demo Practices

1. **Interactive section first** — one instance driven by settings, shows live control.
2. **Variants section** — all variants in a row/grid.
3. **Sizes section** — all sizes.
4. **Feature sections** — e.g. "With icon", "Closable", "Colors" for specific props.
5. **needsContrast for dark bg** — when demoing `color="contrast"` or `color="soft"`, wrap in container with `needsContrast(null, color) && 'bg-primary'` so text is visible.
6. **SettingSelect for null/undefined** — use `{ label: '— (inherit)', value: 'null' }` and convert `color === 'null' ? undefined : color` when passing to component.

### 2.6 components-utils

- `DemoRoot` — vertical Stack wrapper
- `DemoSection` — title + optional desc + children + optional Separator
- `DemoLabel` — caption for labels (size: xs | sm | md)
- `SettingSelect` — dropdown, options: `string[]` or `{ label, value }[]`
- `SettingToggle` — Switch for boolean, uses `toggle(id)` from settings-store

### 2.7 settings-store

- `useSettings<T>()` — read current state
- `useUpdateSettings<T>()` — returns `[update, toggle]`; `update({ key: value })`, `toggle('key')`
- `useReset<T>(defaultState)` — reset + apply defaults on mount
- State is global per Playground; `id` in SettingSelect/SettingToggle must match `ComponentDemoState` keys.

### 2.8 Register in components.tsx

```tsx
import { DemoComponent } from './demo-<name>'
import { DemoComponentSettings } from './demo-<name>-settings'

// In componentDemos array:
{
  id: 'component-id',
  name: 'Component',
  group: 'base',  // or 'forms', 'feedback', 'layout', 'icons'
  description: 'Short description',
  ready: true,
  demo: <DemoComponent />,
  settings: <DemoComponentSettings />,
}
```

### 2.9 Group Labels

`groupLabels` in components.tsx: `base`, `icons`, `forms`, `feedback`, `layout`.

