## Part 3: Checklist

### Wrapper

- [ ] shadcn component installed in `src/ui/shadcn/`
- [ ] Wrapper in `src/ui/<name>.tsx` with forwardRef
- [ ] Types from `./types` (SemanticColor, textSizeClasses) where applicable
- [ ] Helpers from `./utils` (needsContrast, disabledLinkClasses) where applicable
- [ ] Map wrapper variant/size to shadcn (e.g. primary→default, md→default)
- [ ] Export from `src/ui/index.ts`
- [ ] No direct `@/ui/shadcn/*` imports in features/app

### Demo

- [ ] `demo-<name>.tsx` and `demo-<name>-settings.tsx` created
- [ ] `ComponentDemoState` type, `defaultState`, `useEffect(() => reset(), [])` in settings
- [ ] Interactive section with `useSettings<ComponentDemoState>()`
- [ ] Variants and Sizes sections
- [ ] Feature-specific sections (icon, closable, etc.)
- [ ] needsContrast for contrast/soft color demos
- [ ] Registered in `componentDemos` with `ready: true`

### Code Style

- [ ] Single-line comments, lowercase
- [ ] Import order (external → internal → sibling → type)
- [ ] `cn()` for conditional classes
- [ ] Named exports, function declarations
